{"id":"20d4e2ccede99498","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-turing-machine.md","title":"Deterministic Turing Machines","display":"df-turing-machine — Deterministic Turing Machines","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-turing-machine","aliases":["57-df-turing-machine"],"display":"df-turing-machine — Deterministic Turing Machines","depends_on":["[[57-df-partial-function]]","[[57-df-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-turing-machine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-turing-machine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-machine — Deterministic Turing Machines"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cda5e2779ea7246f\" href=\"?note=cda5e2779ea7246f\" title=\"57-df-partial-function\">57-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b2e96ed477b7b031\" href=\"?note=b2e96ed477b7b031\" title=\"57-df-encoding\">57-df-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>背景为 ZFC。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma=\\{0,1,2\\}\">\\(\\Gamma=\\{0,1,2\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> 是空白；带位置为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span>，状态为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>，初态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>、停机态 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span>，移动量为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-1,0,1\">\\(-1,0,1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Partial}\">\\(\\mathrm{Partial}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cda5e2779ea7246f\" href=\"?note=cda5e2779ea7246f\" title=\"57-df-partial-function\">57-df-partial-function</a>；有限列及其长度使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b2e96ed477b7b031\" href=\"?note=b2e96ed477b7b031\" title=\"57-df-encoding\">57-df-encoding</a>。机器是有限转移函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>，带是只记录非空白格的有限函数图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span>。未列转移及停机状态在 Step 下保持原配置；只有状态 1 算停机。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathbb N,p\\in\\mathbb Z,b\\in\\Gamma\">\\(q\\in\\mathbb N,p\\in\\mathbb Z,b\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w,v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(w,v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(j\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Tape}\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Tape}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(r\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}\">\\(d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}\\)</span>。Step 的第一分支中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,b,d\">\\(r,b,d\\)</span> 是唯一转移值的三个分量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(q,a)\">\\(M(q,a)\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(\\langle q,a\\rangle)\">\\(M(\\langle q,a\\rangle)\\)</span> 的点值简写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tape}\\coloneqq\\{t:\\mathrm{Partial}(t,\\mathbb Z,\\{0,1\\})\\land|t|&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Conf}\\coloneqq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb Z\\times\\mathrm{Tape}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Tape}\\coloneqq\\{t:\\mathrm{Partial}(t,\\mathbb Z,\\{0,1\\})\\land|t|&lt;\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Conf}\\coloneqq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb Z\\times\\mathrm{Tape}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\mathrm{Partial}(M,(\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{1\\})\\times\\Gamma,\\mathbb N\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,0,1\\})\\land|M|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\mathrm{Partial}(M,(\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{1\\})\\times\\Gamma,\\mathbb N\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,0,1\\})\\land|M|&lt;\\aleph_0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rd}(t,p)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}t(p)&amp;p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t),\\\\2&amp;p\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(t),\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\operatorname{wr}(t,p,b)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}t\\setminus(\\{p\\}\\times\\{0,1\\})&amp;b=2,\\\\(t\\setminus(\\{p\\}\\times\\{0,1\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle p,b\\rangle\\}&amp;b\\in\\{0,1\\}.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rd}(t,p)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}t(p)&amp;p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t),\\\\2&amp;p\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(t),\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\operatorname{wr}(t,p,b)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}t\\setminus(\\{p\\}\\times\\{0,1\\})&amp;b=2,\\\\(t\\setminus(\\{p\\}\\times\\{0,1\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle p,b\\rangle\\}&amp;b\\in\\{0,1\\}.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Init}(w)\\coloneqq\\langle0,0,\\{\\langle i,w(i)\\rangle:i&lt;|w|\\}\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Init}(w)\\coloneqq\\langle0,0,\\{\\langle i,w(i)\\rangle:i&lt;|w|\\}\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}(M,\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\langle r,p+d,\\operatorname{wr}(t,p,b)\\rangle&amp;\\langle q,\\operatorname{rd}(t,p)\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\land M(q,\\operatorname{rd}(t,p))=\\langle r,b,d\\rangle,\\\\\n\\langle q,p,t\\rangle&amp;\\langle q,\\operatorname{rd}(t,p)\\rangle\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(M).\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Step}(M,\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\langle r,p+d,\\operatorname{wr}(t,p,b)\\rangle&amp;\\langle q,\\operatorname{rd}(t,p)\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\land M(q,\\operatorname{rd}(t,p))=\\langle r,b,d\\rangle,\\\\\n\\langle q,p,t\\rangle&amp;\\langle q,\\operatorname{rd}(t,p)\\rangle\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(M).\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HaltConf}(\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow q=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,0)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Init}(w),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,j+1)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Step}(M,\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,j)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HaltConf}(\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow q=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,0)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Init}(w),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,j+1)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Step}(M,\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,j)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{blen}(t)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{rd}(t,i)=2\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Num}(\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{rd}(t,i)\\ne1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{blen}(t)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{rd}(t,i)=2\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Num}(\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{rd}(t,i)\\ne1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OutWord}(\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\operatorname{rd}(t,0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{rd}(t,\\operatorname{blen}(t)-1)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OutWord}(\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\operatorname{rd}(t,0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{rd}(t,\\operatorname{blen}(t)-1)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{blen}(t)\\le|t|,\\qquad\\operatorname{Num}(\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\le|t|,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{OutWord}:\\mathrm{Conf}\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{blen}(t)\\le|t|,\\qquad\\operatorname{Num}(\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\le|t|,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{OutWord}:\\mathrm{Conf}\\to\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TMVal}(M,w,v)\\leftrightarrow M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\;[\\operatorname{HaltConf}(\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,j))\\land v=\\operatorname{OutWord}(\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,j))].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TMVal}(M,w,v)\\leftrightarrow M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\;[\\operatorname{HaltConf}(\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,j))\\land v=\\operatorname{OutWord}(\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,j))].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TMOut}(M)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in(\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega})^2:\\operatorname{TMVal}(M,w,v)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{TMOut}(M):\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TMOut}(M)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in(\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega})^2:\\operatorname{TMVal}(M,w,v)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{TMOut}(M):\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}^{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>二进制字输出取从位置 0 到第一个空白前的有限段。数值编号另取初始连续 1 的个数 Num；每次数值停机都有唯一自然数输出，不依赖带内容碰巧是规范数码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"cda5e2779ea7246f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"b2e96ed477b7b031","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"cda5e2779ea7246f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"背景为 ZFC。$\\Gamma=\\{0,1,2\\}$，其中 $2$ 是空白；带位置为 $\\mathbb Z$，状态为 $\\mathbb N$，初态 $0$、停机态 $1$，移动量为 $-1,0,1$。$\\mathrm{Partial}$ 取 [[57-df-partial-function]]；有限列及其长度使用 [[57-df-encoding]]。机器是有限转移函数图 $M$，带是只记录非空白格的有限函数图 $t$。未列转移及停机状态在 Step 下保持原配置；只有状态 1 算停机。$q\\in\\mathbb N,p\\in\\mathbb Z,b\\in\\Gamma$；$w,v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}$，$j\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"b2e96ed477b7b031","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"背景为 ZFC。$\\Gamma=\\{0,1,2\\}$，其中 $2$ 是空白；带位置为 $\\mathbb Z$，状态为 $\\mathbb N$，初态 $0$、停机态 $1$，移动量为 $-1,0,1$。$\\mathrm{Partial}$ 取 [[57-df-partial-function]]；有限列及其长度使用 [[57-df-encoding]]。机器是有限转移函数图 $M$，带是只记录非空白格的有限函数图 $t$。未列转移及停机状态在 Step 下保持原配置；只有状态 1 算停机。$q\\in\\mathbb N,p\\in\\mathbb Z,b\\in\\Gamma$；$w,v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}$，$j\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma=\\{0,1,2\\}","display":false},{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"-1,0,1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Partial}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false},{"tex":"q\\in\\mathbb N,p\\in\\mathbb Z,b\\in\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"w,v\\in\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"j\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathrm{Tape}","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"r,b,d","display":false},{"tex":"M(q,a)","display":false},{"tex":"M(\\langle q,a\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tape}\\coloneqq\\{t:\\mathrm{Partial}(t,\\mathbb Z,\\{0,1\\})\\land|t|<\\aleph_0\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Conf}\\coloneqq\\mathbb N\\times\\mathbb Z\\times\\mathrm{Tape}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\mathrm{Partial}(M,(\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{1\\})\\times\\Gamma,\\mathbb N\\times\\Gamma\\times\\{-1,0,1\\})\\land|M|<\\aleph_0\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rd}(t,p)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}t(p)&p\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t),\\\\2&p\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(t),\\end{cases}\\qquad\n\\operatorname{wr}(t,p,b)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}t\\setminus(\\{p\\}\\times\\{0,1\\})&b=2,\\\\(t\\setminus(\\{p\\}\\times\\{0,1\\}))\\cup\\{\\langle p,b\\rangle\\}&b\\in\\{0,1\\}.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Init}(w)\\coloneqq\\langle0,0,\\{\\langle i,w(i)\\rangle:i<|w|\\}\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Step}(M,\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\n\\langle r,p+d,\\operatorname{wr}(t,p,b)\\rangle&\\langle q,\\operatorname{rd}(t,p)\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{dom}(M)\\land M(q,\\operatorname{rd}(t,p))=\\langle r,b,d\\rangle,\\\\\n\\langle q,p,t\\rangle&\\langle q,\\operatorname{rd}(t,p)\\rangle\\notin\\operatorname{dom}(M).\n\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HaltConf}(\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\leftrightarrow q=1,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,0)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Init}(w),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,j+1)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Step}(M,\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,j)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{blen}(t)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{rd}(t,i)=2\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Num}(\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:\\operatorname{rd}(t,i)\\ne1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OutWord}(\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\operatorname{rd}(t,0),\\ldots,\\operatorname{rd}(t,\\operatorname{blen}(t)-1)\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{blen}(t)\\le|t|,\\qquad\\operatorname{Num}(\\langle q,p,t\\rangle)\\le|t|,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{OutWord}:\\mathrm{Conf}\\to\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TMVal}(M,w,v)\\leftrightarrow M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\land\n\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\;[\\operatorname{HaltConf}(\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,j))\\land v=\\operatorname{OutWord}(\\operatorname{Run}(M,w,j))].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TMOut}(M)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle w,v\\rangle\\in(\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega})^2:\\operatorname{TMVal}(M,w,v)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{TMOut}(M):\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}\\rightharpoonup\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}.","display":true}],"bytes":3434,"backlinks":[{"id":"f3921429aff327c8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X,Y$ 为集合，$\\iota_X:X\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}$、$\\iota_Y:Y\\hookrightarrow\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}$ 为固定单射表示；$f:X\\rightharpoonup Y$。部分函数取 [[57-df-partial-function]]，$\\mathrm{TM},\\operatorname{TMVal}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]。无下标 $\\mathrm{Effective}$ 相对当前固定表示环境定义，不表示未形式化的经验概念。"},{"id":"ad4b08ee803904de","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:A\\rightharpoonup B$ 为 [[57-df-partial-function]] 的部分函数图，$x\\in A$。$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$、$w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}$；机器及运行取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]。两种 $\\downarrow$ 依左侧输入类型区分。$g:A\\rightharpoonup B$ 用于部分值相等。"},{"id":"b9c9625457efede7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"自然数列编码、解码及分量函数取 [[57-df-encoding]]；$\\mathrm{Tape},\\mathrm{Conf},\\operatorname{Num}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]。$\\ell,i,j,s\\in\\mathbb N$，$z\\in\\mathbb Z$。下述列均按零起始编号；$\\operatorname{tenc}$ 是 $\\operatorname{tdec}$ 的逆函数，唯一性由同一断言中的双射性质保证，不作任意选择。$\\operatorname{cdec},\\operatorname{Last},U$ 在非法码上也给定值。"},{"id":"6cf31091f58bf0b5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]，数值串及二元配对编码取 [[57-df-encoding]]。指令列码按键 $\\langle q,a\\rangle_{\\mathbb N}$ 严格递增排序；指令的五个字段依次为状态、读符号、下一状态、写符号、移动量加一。$e,u,i,j\\in\\mathbb N$；所有自然数都作为程序索引，非法表码映射到没有转移、不会停机的空表。"},{"id":"5ab2dcd23faf2b6d","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\ge1$，$e,s\\in\\mathbb N$，$\\vec x\\in D_n$。$D_n$ 及打包约定取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]；$M_e$ 取 [[57-df-program-numbering]]；$\\operatorname{Word}_n$ 取 [[57-df-encoding]]；$\\operatorname{HistCode},\\operatorname{cdec},U$ 取 [[57-df-machine-coding]]；$\\operatorname{Init},\\operatorname{Step},\\operatorname{HaltConf}$ 取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]。$T_n(e,\\vec x,s)$ 使用该固定编号和该固定输入表示。"},{"id":"68e2d5e250a907ad","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$k\\ge1$，$f\\in\\mathcal P_k$；$D_k$、数值元组及打包映射取 [[57-df-composition-operator]]。输入和输出使用 [[57-df-encoding]] 的同一 $\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{Word}_k$ 表示。$\\mathrm{Effective}_{\\iota_X,\\iota_Y}$ 取 [[57-df-effective-procedure]] 的机器谓词，底层机器取 [[57-df-turing-machine]]；$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ 取 [[57-df-recursive-function]]。本环境固定 $X=D_k,Y=\\mathbb N,\\iota_X=\\operatorname{in}_k,\\iota_Y=\\operatorname{out}$。正规形对应取 [[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]。"},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-235","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-addition-function]]\n[[57-df-composition-operator]]\n[[57-df-divrem-function]]\n[[57-df-effective-procedure]]\n[[57-df-encoding]]\n[[57-df-factorial-function]]\n[[57-df-function-closure]]\n[[57-df-halt-notation]]\n[[57-df-machine-coding]]\n[[57-df-min-operator-generalized]]\n[[57-df-multiplication-function]]\n[[57-df-normal-form-theorem]]\n[[57-df-primrec-operator]]\n[[57-df-program-numbering]]\n[[57-df-projection-function]]\n[[57-df-recursive-function-class]]\n[[57-df-recursively-enumerable-predicate]]\n[[57-df-sequence-concatenation]]\n[[57-df-successor-function]]\n[[57-df-t-predicate]]\n[[57-df-turing-machine]]\n[[57-df-zero-function]]"}],"outgoing":["cda5e2779ea7246f","b2e96ed477b7b031"]}